{"unit_id":"tag:03FO:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节简要讨论改变大景（sites）时的情形。结果是，我们总能任意扩大大景（site），因此可以假设我们想要考虑的任何概形（schemes）的集合（set）都包含在我们考虑代数空间（algebraic space）所依据的大 fppf 景（site）中。下面精确陈述这一结果。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"改变大景。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"包含所考虑概形的大 fppf 景。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待纳入大景的概形。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"概形组成的集合。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"在大 fppf 景上考虑的代数空间。"}],"notes":[]}
