{"unit_id":"tag:03FO:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，这个引理纯粹是集合（set）论的，几乎没有内容。此外，大景（site）上的代数空间（algebraic space）限制到小景（site）上后是代数空间（algebraic space），这一点（一般而言）并不成立（仅仅是基数（cardinality）方面的原因）。因此，我们只能用这种简单的引理来扩大基范畴（category），而不能缩小它。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"引理属于集合论。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"比较大小两个景。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"代数空间向较小景的限制。"},{"source_term":"cardinality","target_term":"基数","context":"限制后未必为代数空间的基数原因。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"代数空间所依据的基范畴。"}],"notes":[]}
